## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Druid
## Notes: The druid one-stop HUD for WoW Forever: mana in forms, energy and rage, combo points, role-aware cooldowns, buffs and procs, your DoTs/HoTs on target, click-to-cast reminders, aggro radius on enemy nameplates and Skyborne ley lines.
